@AgileRetro.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164
@sessionCode = ABC123
@participantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{AgileRetro.WebApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Issue a LiveKit access token
POST {{AgileRetro.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/sessions/{{sessionCode}}/livekit-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantId": "{{participantId}}"
}

